{"id": "housing-authority-subsidies-and-central-office-fees", "title": "The housing subsidy San Francisco lost while it reorganized repairs", "seconds": 55.6, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "c309236b3e162133", "words": 155, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "San Francisco lost part of its federal housing subsidy.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.22, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Five", "years", "of", "lower", "subsidies"], "sub": "Five years of lower federal operating subsidy"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.81, 1.07, 1.25, 1.35, 1.5, 1.86, 2.21]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The city auditor put five years of reductions at $7.5 million.", "t0": 3.34, "t1": 7.89, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$7.5 million", "label": "Five years of lower federal operating subsidy"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.47, 0.88, 1.09, 1.41, 1.63, 1.74, 2.51, 2.75, 3.1, 3.37, 3.68, 4.03]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Federal rules let housing authorities stop reductions by managing properties individually.", "t0": 8.01, "t1": 13.08, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "subsidy", "kicker": "Five years of lower federal operating subsidy", "text": "Operating Fund rules", "mark": "Operating"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.97, 1.22, 1.54, 1.99, 2.32, 2.94, 3.12, 3.54, 4.05]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Specialized crews moved to housing sites, then back to a central unit.", "t0": 13.3, "t1": 17.05, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "subsidy", "context": "Audit trail", "heading": "Where the repair teams worked", "rows": [{"label": "2010", "value": "At housing sites", "icon": "document"}, {"label": "2012", "value": "Back in central services", "icon": "document"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.71, 1.1, 1.36, 1.47, 1.86, 2.4, 2.65, 2.91, 3.04, 3.12, 3.53]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The audit also identified rent collection, fee and budgeting problems.", "t0": 17.17, "t1": 21.4, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "subsidy", "kicker": "Centralized repairs were one of several obstacles", "text": "Several controls fell short", "mark": "Several"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.51, 0.82, 1.42, 1.66, 2.53, 2.91, 3.1, 3.54]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Ten days after the audit, officials reported three ratified labor agreements.", "t0": 21.52, "t1": 25.51, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "subsidy", "kicker": "Centralized repairs were one of several obstacles", "text": "June 2013 hearing", "mark": "June"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.5, 0.73, 0.87, 1.47, 1.98, 2.39, 2.67, 3.13, 3.41]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A federal field review later accepted the change in property management.", "t0": 25.63, "t1": 28.99, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "January 2014 field review"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.55, 0.84, 1.14, 1.42, 1.86, 1.96, 2.28, 2.4, 2.8]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Federal auditors then asked San Francisco to support or repay a separate set of fees.", "t0": 29.11, "t1": 34.03, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fees", "kicker": "A separate federal test questioned $6,191,321 in fees", "text": "Recommendation 1D", "mark": "Recommendation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.78, 1.01, 1.45, 1.71, 2.19, 2.32, 2.8, 3.0, 3.45, 3.58, 3.91, 4.09, 4.2]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Those fees totaled more than six million dollars across two fiscal years.", "t0": 34.15, "t1": 37.91, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "fees", "context": "Audit trail", "heading": "Fees requiring support", "layout": "amounts", "rows": [{"label": "Management", "value": "$5,398,225", "icon": "document"}, {"label": "Bookkeeping", "value": "$460,850", "icon": "document"}, {"label": "Asset management", "value": "$332,246", "icon": "document"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.6, 1.0, 1.16, 1.34, 1.61, 1.93, 2.29, 2.63, 2.91, 3.32]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "One difference arose between the internal calculation and the federal submission.", "t0": 38.03, "t1": 41.91, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Internal calculation", "$418,320"], "b": ["Federal submission", "$750,566"], "kicker": "Fiscal 2009 asset management fees"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.63, 0.97, 1.28, 1.38, 1.73, 2.58, 2.81, 2.94, 3.33]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The auditors allowed for a possible accounting classification error.", "t0": 42.03, "t1": 45.52, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Classification remained unresolved"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.64, 1.03, 1.19, 1.27, 1.71, 2.15, 2.97]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "A later plan shows general repair crews assigned to housing sites.", "t0": 45.74, "t1": 49.26, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "plan", "kicker": "The later maintenance plan assigns mechanics to housing sites", "text": "Site-based maintenance mechanics", "mark": "Site-based"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.44, 0.79, 1.13, 1.49, 1.84, 2.2, 2.58, 2.69, 3.05]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The remaining question is how the federal fee review ended.", "t0": 49.38, "t1": 52.25, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "How were the fees resolved?"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.48, 0.88, 1.0, 1.14, 1.27, 1.68, 1.9, 2.24]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 52.37, "t1": 54.74, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Five years of lower federal operating subsidy", "b": "Centralized repairs were one of several obstacles", "o": "The later maintenance plan assigns mechanics to housing sites"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "contrast"}